licenses in the module cache.

The Supabase services run as separate upstream container images
(supabase/postgres, supabase/gotrue, postgrest, realtime, storage-api,
supabase/studio, kong, imgproxy and related images) and are not distributed as
part of this source tree. Each image carries its own license.

